# Content OS — autonomous cadence (mirrors scheduler.config.json).
# 1) Replace __REPO__ with the absolute repo path (e.g. /home/fatiha/content-system).
# 2) Install with:  crontab deploy/crontab.example
# 3) Check with:    crontab -l
#
# TIMEZONE (fixed 05/10/2026, unblocker UNB-030): Debian/Ubuntu's "cron"
# package (3.0pl1, confirmed via `man 5 crontab` and live behavior on the
# estate VPS) does NOT honor CRON_TZ as a scheduling offset — only "cronie"
# does. CRON_TZ=Asia/Dubai was silently inert here: every job fired at its
# literal clock number in the system's own timezone (UTC), 4 hours later
# than every comment below's documented GST intent. The times below are now
# the real UTC numbers for that same GST intent (UTC = GST − 4h); each
# comment keeps stating the GST time a human should think in. If this repo
# is ever installed on a host running "cronie" (which does honor CRON_TZ),
# either keep these UTC numbers and drop CRON_TZ, or restore CRON_TZ=Asia/Dubai
# and put the original GST numbers back — don't mix the two conventions.
SHELL=/bin/bash

# ── M00 — Brain Manager ──────────────────────────────────────
# Daily @ 20:00 — asks the operator questions via Telegram, updates personal-brain.md.
# This is the Cerveau Manager: the personal context layer that makes posts feel real.
0 16 * * *   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/brain-manager" 0 0

# ── Review Cockpit — the 5-minute morning ritual ─────────────
# Daily @ 07:30 — sends the overnight drafts to Telegram as numbered cards
# (approve / edit-by-voice-note / kill). Twice-daily process sweeps apply the
# replies to the vault, route unblocker replies + brain voice notes, and log
# every decision for the Taste Clone.
30 3 * * *   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/review-cockpit digest" 0 0
30 8 * * *   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/review-cockpit process" 0 0
30 16 * * *  __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/review-cockpit process" 0 0

# ── The Unblocker — AI Chief of Staff ────────────────────────
# Daily @ 08:00 — scans the estate, picks ONE prepped 15-min unblock task,
# delivers it via Telegram. Execution window 09:00-12:00. Follow-up +
# status write-back happen inside the run.
0 4 * * *    __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/unblocker daily" 0 0

# ── M01 — Signal Harvest + Script Generation ─────────────────
# Daily @ 02:00 — harvest 7 signals from the live web.
0 22 * * *   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/signal-harvester" 1 120

# Daily @ 02:30 — generate 5 scripts (1 story, 2 news, 1 opinion, 1 edu).
# Scripts are ready when the operator wakes up. Uses personal-brain.md + latest signals.
30 22 * * *  __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/content-engine daily" 1 120

# ── M06 — Performance Tracker ────────────────────────────────
# Daily @ 03:00 — scrape engagement metrics, annotate vault entries.
0 23 * * *   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/performance-tracker" 0 0

# ── Full weekly loop ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Monday @ 06:00 — runs the full machine chain (signal → script → visual → queue).
0 2 * * 1    __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/weekly-ops" 1 240

# ── Revenue Watchdog ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily @ 03:30 — reconcile Whop/Stripe/GHL into revenue-log.md. Harmless
# while dormant (no keys / no checkout yet): it just reports status.
30 23 * * *  __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/revenue-watchdog daily" 0 0

# ── Weekly intelligence + hygiene ────────────────────────────
# Sunday 05:00 — distill the research-inbox week into a RESEARCH entry + brief.
0 1 * * 0    __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/inbox-distiller weekly" 1 120
# Sunday 05:30 — recompile taste-file.md from the week's review decisions.
30 1 * * 0   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/taste-clone compile" 0 0
# Sunday 06:30 — estate hygiene scan across the 8 repos.
30 2 * * 0   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/estate-janitor scan" 0 0
# Monday 05:30 — refresh the speaking pipeline (new events/targets this week).
30 1 * * 1   __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/speaking-pipeline scan" 1 120

# ── M05 — DM/Lead Responder ─────────────────────────────────
# Every 5 min — polls comments for keyword CTAs, sends DMs via GHL (IG) + Unipile
# (LinkedIn). Harmless to leave running — it just reports status until wired.
# PAUSED by owner 2026-09-14: */5 * * * *  __REPO__/deploy/run-machine.sh "/dm-responder" 0 0

# =============================================================
# AI Insider Brief (paths assume the estate VPS after deploy/brief-migration;
# on the legacy brief VPS use /root/ai-insider-brief-pipeline instead) (runs on the brief VPS, not the estate VPS)
# These lines are NOT for the run-machine.sh estate loop above — they call
# plain node scripts directly. Install on the separate brief VPS
# (root@187.77.153.212 per ai-insider-brief/CONTEXT.md), where this repo's
# ai-insider-brief/ai-insider-brief/pipeline/ contents are deployed flattened
# into /root/ai-insider-brief-pipeline/ (see ai-insider-brief/DEPLOY.md).
# The persistent approval bot (pm2 process "insider-brief-bot", not cron)
# is the only thing that ever calls Kit's send API, and only after a human
# taps "Send to subscribers" in Telegram — see approval-bot.mjs.
# =============================================================
# Crawl + synth — every 12 hours. Queues new cards for Telegram approval.
0 */12 * * *  cd $HOME/content-system/ai-insider-brief/ai-insider-brief/pipeline && node run.mjs >> /var/log/insider-brief-pipeline.log 2>&1

# Health check — hourly. Alerts Telegram if the bot/Ollama/frontend/briefs.json look wrong.
0 * * * *     cd $HOME/content-system/ai-insider-brief/ai-insider-brief/pipeline && node health-check.mjs >> /var/log/insider-brief-health.log 2>&1

# Weekly self-audit — Sunday. Dead feeds, filler verdicts, empty verticals, queue depth.
0 5 * * 0     cd $HOME/content-system/ai-insider-brief/ai-insider-brief/pipeline && node weekly-audit.mjs >> /var/log/insider-brief-audit.log 2>&1

# Tuesday send-approval preview — 05:30 GST. Drops a trigger file; the
# always-on approval bot turns it into a Telegram preview with Send/Skip
# buttons. NOTHING sends to subscribers from this line alone.
30 5 * * 2    cd $HOME/content-system/ai-insider-brief/ai-insider-brief/pipeline && node tuesday-preview.mjs >> /var/log/insider-brief-preview.log 2>&1
